    4. Choose two non-overlapping positions (r1,c1) and (r2,c2) for the sprite bbox such that both fit within the grid and their bounding boxes do not overlap (gap >= 1 row or column)
    5. Place the sprite at (r1,c1) as the original
    6. Place a gray pixel at the center of (r2,c2) as the marker
